<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen bourse to close on June 30 and July 1.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen bourse to close on June 30 and July 1.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange in China's southern city of Shenzhen will close on June 30 and July 1 to mark the Hong Kong handover, the exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trading on the exchange would resume on July 2, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Beijing has declared July 1 a national holiday to celebrate the resumption of Chinese sovereignty after more than 150 years of British colonial rule over Hong Kong.</p>
